# Files that git should ignore: the large results that Allrun regenerates
# (0/ is made again from 0.orig/ by every run, and waveCoeffs by stokesV.py).
# (The scripts, the CSV files, the figures, your notes and the set-up files of
# every case and run are still committed.) Name your run folders so that they
# do not start with a digit: folders such as 1/ or 250/ are results.
[1-9]*/
0/
0.[0-9]*/
**/constant/polyMesh/
processor*/
postProcessing/
log.*
*.foam
waveCoeffs
# animations made by scripts/animate.py (make them again from the run)
*.avi
*.ogv
*.[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].png
__pycache__/
